Package: ffmpeg-rockchip-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Multi-Arch: same
Maintainer: rk-builder maintainers <whoarei@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: rockchip-mpp-dev (>= 1.1.0), librga-dev (>= 1.10.6), libdrm2 (>= 2.4), libc6 (>= 2.17)
Conflicts: libavcodec-dev, libavdevice-dev, libavfilter-dev, libavformat-dev, libavutil-dev, libswresample-dev, libswscale-dev
Homepage: https://github.com/nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip
Description: FFmpeg 6.1 with Rockchip hardware acceleration (rkmpp/rkrga)
 FFmpeg libraries with Rockchip RKMPP hardware codecs and RKRGA scaling,
 cross-compiled from nyanmisaka/ffmpeg-rockchip. Installs into the Debian
 multiarch paths and replaces the stock Debian FFmpeg dev packages in the
 sysroot.
